1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 18]</font>

15
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sun Mansion]</font>

16
00:01:18,720 --> 00:01:19,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Sun,</font>

17
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you trying to silence us for good?</font>

18
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In all my life,</font>

19
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've kept a clear conscience.</font>

20
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Mingcheng</font>

21
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is my only son.</font>

22
00:01:28,080 --> 00:01:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anything happens to him,</font>

23
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our family</font>

24
00:01:32,120 --> 00:01:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will have no heir.</font>

25
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not blame me.</font>

26
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My poor child.</font>

27
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:39,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He was forced into this.</font>

28
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan!</font>

29
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

30
00:01:44,200 --> 00:01:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You exposed yourselves</font>

31
00:01:45,880 --> 00:01:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on purpose.</font>

32
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seize him!</font>

33
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

34
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

35
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is she?</font>

36
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two were hit with a knockout drug.</font>

37
00:01:54,440 --> 00:01:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Setting a trap with yourself as bait
is dangerous.</font>

38
00:01:55,960 --> 00:01:56,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you dragged Qinglan into it.</font>

39
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You even let her get drugged.</font>

40
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How utterly useless can you be?</font>

41
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't leave Qinglan with you.</font>

42
00:02:04,800 --> 00:02:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you?</font>

43
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

44
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Reliable as always.</font>

45
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

46
00:02:09,760 --> 00:02:10,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look who brought the medicine.</font>

47
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

48
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quick.</font>

49
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:15,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince</font>

50
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has no use for this worthless thing.</font>

51
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm taking Qinglan away.</font>

52
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay here by yourself.</font>

53
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did I let you smell it?</font>

54
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take him back.</font>

55
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:27,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Interrogate him thoroughly.</font>

56
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

57
00:02:28,200 --> 00:02:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

58
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't take him away yet.</font>

59
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:31,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

60
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't take him away yet.</font>

61
00:02:36,240 --> 00:02:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you giving me orders?</font>

62
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Silence.</font>

63
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just take him back</font>

64
00:02:47,640 --> 00:02:48,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for interrogation.</font>

65
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:49,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are we still here?</font>

66
00:02:50,920 --> 00:02:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Sun family upholds
strict discipline.</font>

67
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He would never abandon his father</font>

68
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and flee alone.</font>

69
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Prince means</font>

70
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Sun Mingcheng</font>

71
00:02:57,760 --> 00:02:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is likely still hiding here.</font>

72
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What we need to do</font>

73
00:03:00,640 --> 00:03:01,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is force him out.</font>

74
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

75
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">intimidation is your specialty.</font>

76
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:08,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perhaps you should handle this.</font>

77
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no.</font>

78
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Allow me.</font>

79
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When it comes to scaring people,</font>

80
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just as good as he is.</font>

81
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:13,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Leave it to me.</font>

82
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How dare you touch my coroner.</font>

83
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You truly have a death wish.</font>

84
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you know what I'm capable of?</font>

85
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Kill me or torture me.</font>

86
00:03:25,040 --> 00:03:26,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do as you please.</font>

87
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:29,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've got quite the nerve.</font>

88
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you believe I'll slice you up?</font>

89
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:35,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Intimidation won't work on him.</font>

90
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A scholar's mouth like his</font>

91
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be pried open with brute force.</font>

92
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

93
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Excellent.</font>

94
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cut him.</font>

95
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brothers,</font>

96
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:44,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pretend you saw nothing.</font>

97
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well then,</font>

98
00:03:46,160 --> 00:03:47,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let's start by bleeding him out.</font>

99
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bleed him out?</font>

100
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That will be a gruesome scene.</font>

101
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Brothers,</font>

102
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:52,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you shouldn't be seeing this.</font>

103
00:03:55,440 --> 00:03:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Release my father!</font>

104
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

105
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

106
00:03:59,240 --> 00:04:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You brat!</font>

107
00:04:00,640 --> 00:04:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you to hide.</font>

108
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you come out?</font>

109
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have been unfilial.</font>

110
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:07,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've brought suffering upon you.</font>

111
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My suffering means nothing.</font>

112
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If our family line ends,</font>

113
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will have failed our ancestors.</font>

114
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

115
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

116
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He has only fainted.</font>

117
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun Mingcheng,</font>

118
00:04:21,760 --> 00:04:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as long as you tell us</font>

119
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the whole story clearly,</font>

120
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we will release your father.</font>

121
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll talk.</font>

122
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once, by accident,</font>

123
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I stumbled upon Cui Tai,</font>

124
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xia Bohou, and their gang.</font>

125
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

126
00:04:45,400 --> 00:04:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you see something?</font>

127
00:04:46,360 --> 00:04:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you see something?</font>

128
00:04:47,400 --> 00:04:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spit it out. Did you see it?</font>

129
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare breathe a word,</font>

130
00:04:54,200 --> 00:04:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll beat you to death.</font>

131
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop hitting me!</font>

132
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's for spying.</font>

133
00:04:59,760 --> 00:05:00,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though they gave me a beating,</font>

134
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't help but wonder</font>

135
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what it would feel like</font>

136
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to consume that substance.</font>

137
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

138
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I snuck into Cui Tai's room.</font>

139
00:05:09,760 --> 00:05:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But soon, I realized</font>

140
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that stuff is addictive.</font>

141
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you've tasted it,</font>

142
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll crave it again</font>

143
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:16,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and again.</font>

144
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Until one day,</font>

145
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I saw Cui Tai rush back to his room</font>

146
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a dazed state.</font>

147
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun Mingcheng.</font>

148
00:05:32,440 --> 00:05:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're stealing.</font>

149
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Let me go.
- What did you take?</font>

150
00:05:36,320 --> 00:05:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't leave. Hand it over.</font>

151
00:05:39,200 --> 00:05:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you have?</font>

152
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me go.</font>

153
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give it to me.</font>

154
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All I could think was</font>

155
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that no one should find his body.</font>

156
00:06:21,760 --> 00:06:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There was a well in Scholar's Grove.</font>

157
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:24,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I just</font>

158
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">threw him into it.</font>

159
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sun.</font>

160
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help!</font>

161
00:06:36,360 --> 00:06:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No!</font>

162
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go to hell!</font>

163
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You already know</font>

164
00:06:44,360 --> 00:06:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what happened next.</font>

165
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined</font>

166
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Divine Dust could be so potent</font>

167
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that even a model student like you</font>

168
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">couldn't resist its temptation.</font>

169
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:55,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop acting so righteous.</font>

170
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We could have covered this all up</font>

171
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if it weren't for you.</font>

172
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan, look out!</font>

173
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief!</font>

174
00:07:09,200 --> 00:07:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief!</font>

175
00:07:09,960 --> 00:07:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you alright?</font>

176
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine.</font>

177
00:07:11,920 --> 00:07:12,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was just a vase.</font>

178
00:07:12,680 --> 00:07:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can't hurt me.</font>

179
00:07:13,560 --> 00:07:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not hurt, are you?</font>

180
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You dare strike me?</font>

181
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

182
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it.</font>

183
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's already buried in charges.</font>

184
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take him back for trial.</font>

185
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take him away.</font>

186
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

187
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:29,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The five colors blind the eye.</font>

188
00:07:29,880 --> 00:07:31,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The five tones deafen the ear.</font>

189
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The five flavors dull the palate.</font>

190
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The chase and the hunt</font>

191
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:38,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">drive the heart wild.</font>

192
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What does he mean?</font>

193
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The five colors, tones, and flavors</font>

194
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:44,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">refer to all the beautiful things</font>

195
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in this world.</font>

196
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He doesn't want to just bury
his nose in books all day.</font>

197
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:49,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That makes sense.</font>

198
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a pair of fools.</font>

199
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Imperial Prison]</font>

200
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

201
00:07:56,640 --> 00:07:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A teacher for a day,</font>

202
00:07:58,240 --> 00:07:59,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a father for life.</font>

203
00:08:01,200 --> 00:08:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can you really bear
to leave three children</font>

204
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">stuck here for a whole month?</font>

205
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Doesn't your heart ache at all?</font>

206
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When parents love their children,</font>

207
00:08:12,080 --> 00:08:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they plan for their distant future.</font>

208
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on, break this habit.</font>

209
00:08:15,480 --> 00:08:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bury your heads in your books.</font>

210
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One day, serve the nation.</font>

211
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is your only path forward.</font>

212
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, please!</font>

213
00:08:21,360 --> 00:08:21,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

214
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your family is a lineage
of officials and scholars.</font>

215
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did it come to this</font>

216
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in your generation?</font>

217
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Use this month to reflect deeply.</font>

218
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Behave yourselves.</font>

219
00:08:31,880 --> 00:08:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No!</font>

220
00:08:32,560 --> 00:08:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother!</font>

221
00:08:39,520 --> 00:08:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was worth it in the end.</font>

222
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We did learn a few things.</font>

223
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We got all the answers we needed.</font>

224
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can finally</font>

225
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">set aside</font>

226
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this identity as a teacher.</font>

227
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you two talking about?</font>

228
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing much.</font>

229
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:53,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

230
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I leave those men inside to you.</font>

231
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will discipline them strictly.</font>

232
00:08:58,280 --> 00:08:59,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are merely spoiled.</font>

233
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They aren't bad at heart.</font>

234
00:09:02,160 --> 00:09:03,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See that the warden treats them well.</font>

235
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After all,</font>

236
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they are sons of high officials.</font>

237
00:09:06,280 --> 00:09:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know.</font>

238
00:09:07,280 --> 00:09:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't need to tell me.</font>

239
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

240
00:09:11,280 --> 00:09:12,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we couldn't have solved this case
without you.</font>

241
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

242
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope that from now on,</font>

243
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll put your own safety first.</font>

244
00:09:17,400 --> 00:09:19,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still have parents.</font>

245
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you ever considered</font>

246
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that if you were hurt,</font>

247
00:09:22,880 --> 00:09:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how they would feel?</font>

248
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:25,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember:</font>

249
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aside from family and those you love,</font>

250
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one is worth risking your life for.</font>

251
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you understand what I mean?</font>

252
00:09:33,160 --> 00:09:33,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

253
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:35,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Good.</font>

254
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You may go attend to your duties.</font>

255
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must hurry to inform Mr. Cui.</font>

256
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

257
00:09:41,760 --> 00:09:42,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have taken what you just said</font>

258
00:09:43,080 --> 00:09:44,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to heart.</font>

259
00:09:45,080 --> 00:09:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you.</font>

260
00:09:54,120 --> 00:09:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Duke Dingguo's Mansion]</font>

261
00:10:00,120 --> 00:10:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sir,</font>

262
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when will we meet again?</font>

263
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

264
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:23,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at me.</font>

265
00:10:23,600 --> 00:10:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you think</font>

266
00:10:25,480 --> 00:10:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I look especially dashing today?</font>

267
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:28,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan.</font>

268
00:10:29,480 --> 00:10:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong with you?</font>

269
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't disturb my nap.</font>

270
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:34,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget the nap.</font>

271
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

272
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm telling you something serious.</font>

273
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan</font>

274
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:40,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is about to become</font>

275
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your sister-in-law.</font>

276
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two have sealed the deal?</font>

277
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is going on</font>

278
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in that head of yours all day?</font>

279
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why are you so sure?</font>

280
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:53,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She showed concern for me.</font>

281
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that perfectly normal?</font>

282
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:57,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't understand.</font>

283
00:10:58,200 --> 00:10:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today was different.</font>

284
00:10:59,480 --> 00:11:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Qinglan spoke to me,</font>

285
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">her expression was so solemn</font>

286
00:11:02,480 --> 00:11:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and sincere.</font>

287
00:11:03,640 --> 00:11:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her eyes were brimming with tears.</font>

288
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:07,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of it was worry for me.</font>

289
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt</font>

290
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she was truly moved by me.</font>

291
00:11:12,920 --> 00:11:14,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope that from now on,</font>

292
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll put your own safety first.</font>

293
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You still have parents.</font>

294
00:11:19,360 --> 00:11:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you ever considered</font>

295
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that if you were hurt,</font>

296
00:11:22,760 --> 00:11:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how they would feel?</font>

297
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Remember:</font>

298
00:11:26,880 --> 00:11:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aside from family and those you love,</font>

299
00:11:28,920 --> 00:11:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one is worth risking your life for.</font>

300
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you understand what I mean?</font>

301
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you thinking?</font>

302
00:11:42,480 --> 00:11:42,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No way.</font>

303
00:11:43,760 --> 00:11:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before Qinglan changes her mind,</font>

304
00:11:45,440 --> 00:11:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must seize the chance</font>

305
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and seal the deal for good.</font>

306
00:11:48,240 --> 00:11:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sis,</font>

307
00:11:49,320 --> 00:11:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have to help me.</font>

308
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">True.</font>

309
00:11:52,760 --> 00:11:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As long as it helps Jun</font>

310
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:55,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">become part of our family,</font>

311
00:11:56,960 --> 00:11:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will do</font>

312
00:11:57,920 --> 00:11:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everything in my power.</font>

313
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's my sister.</font>

314
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My love for you was not wasted.</font>

315
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course.</font>

316
00:12:05,240 --> 00:12:06,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan.</font>

317
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You used it to wipe your sweat?</font>

318
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

319
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- It's just a handkerchief.
- I'll kill you!</font>

320
00:12:15,240 --> 00:12:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop right there!</font>

321
00:12:17,120 --> 00:12:17,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't run!</font>

322
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

323
00:12:22,120 --> 00:12:22,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master!</font>

324
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've finally returned.</font>

325
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings,</font>

326
00:12:25,760 --> 00:12:27,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty.</font>

327
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's such a long journey.</font>

328
00:12:28,760 --> 00:12:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be exhausted.</font>

329
00:12:30,160 --> 00:12:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

330
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan requests an audience.</font>

331
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:32,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Perfect timing.</font>

332
00:12:33,160 --> 00:12:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show him in at once.</font>

333
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

334
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan,</font>

335
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take a look.</font>

336
00:12:36,640 --> 00:12:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">See who has returned.</font>

337
00:12:41,000 --> 00:12:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

338
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:42,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings,</font>

339
00:12:42,280 --> 00:12:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty.</font>

340
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke.</font>

341
00:12:45,640 --> 00:12:46,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Weren't you investigating</font>

342
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:48,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the salt smuggling case in Suzhou?</font>

343
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:48,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is the matter settled?</font>

344
00:12:49,760 --> 00:12:50,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Suzhou has begun implementing</font>

345
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the new Salt Administration Law he set.</font>

346
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It has resolved a major worry for me.</font>

347
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I summoned him back in secret.</font>

348
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep this quiet for now.</font>

349
00:12:58,960 --> 00:12:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Understood.</font>

350
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This token was found
in Sun Mingcheng's home.</font>

351
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With this,</font>

352
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one can enter a place</font>

353
00:13:08,800 --> 00:13:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">called Nightfall Haven</font>

354
00:13:10,320 --> 00:13:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to purchase the Divine Dust.</font>

355
00:13:18,400 --> 00:13:19,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, Jun!</font>

356
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

357
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just finished reporting to Mr. Cui.</font>

358
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:23,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me go home and rest first.</font>

359
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Can it wait until tomorrow?</font>

360
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

361
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is urgent. We can't delay.</font>

362
00:13:27,680 --> 00:13:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, hurry!</font>

363
00:13:28,680 --> 00:13:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you see that red carpet?</font>

364
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Follow it all the way to the end.</font>

365
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A surprise is waiting for you.</font>

366
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What kind of trick is this?</font>

367
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

368
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">actually, all these years,</font>

369
00:13:45,680 --> 00:13:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've always seen you as a brother.</font>

370
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know when it started,</font>

371
00:13:50,760 --> 00:13:51,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but a very strange feeling</font>

372
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">welled up inside my heart.</font>

373
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:55,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every time I see you,</font>

374
00:13:56,560 --> 00:13:58,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my heart races uncontrollably.</font>

375
00:13:59,760 --> 00:14:01,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But seeing you with Li Congyao</font>

376
00:14:01,920 --> 00:14:02,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes me so angry.</font>

377
00:14:03,920 --> 00:14:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could this be the love</font>

378
00:14:05,920 --> 00:14:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">between a man and a woman</font>

379
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the heavens speak of?</font>

380
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If the heavens would grant me a chance,</font>

381
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll tell her...</font>

382
00:14:16,520 --> 00:14:17,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is she here?</font>

383
00:14:42,720 --> 00:14:44,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is the meaning of this?</font>

384
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:55,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

385
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like you.</font>

386
00:14:58,000 --> 00:14:59,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even if you're a coroner all your life,</font>

387
00:14:59,680 --> 00:15:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even if you were married before,</font>

388
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:02,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will still marry you.</font>

389
00:15:02,720 --> 00:15:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, marry me.</font>

390
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

391
00:15:17,600 --> 00:15:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A coroner?</font>

392
00:15:18,880 --> 00:15:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And she married once?</font>

393
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two,</font>

394
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:23,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you trying to kill me?</font>

395
00:15:24,480 --> 00:15:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father,</font>

396
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew nothing of this.</font>

397
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan has gone too far.</font>

398
00:15:28,280 --> 00:15:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should teach him a proper lesson.</font>

399
00:15:29,840 --> 00:15:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quickly, let's go.</font>

400
00:15:31,440 --> 00:15:32,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying!</font>

401
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you tell me Father had come?</font>

402
00:16:08,960 --> 00:16:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who's there?</font>

403
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei, it's me.</font>

404
00:16:19,960 --> 00:16:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why have you come so late?</font>

405
00:16:22,880 --> 00:16:23,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to see you.</font>

406
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard</font>

407
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that Jiang Yufan</font>

408
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">got a severe beating from his father.</font>

409
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It must be because of me.</font>

410
00:16:38,200 --> 00:16:39,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must find a chance</font>

411
00:16:39,160 --> 00:16:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to explain things to the Chief.</font>

412
00:16:43,880 --> 00:16:44,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

413
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you could choose again,</font>

414
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would you prefer to be Jun Qinglan?</font>

415
00:16:52,400 --> 00:16:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I chose again,</font>

416
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:55,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what would you do?</font>

417
00:16:57,800 --> 00:16:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would certainly...</font>

418
00:17:00,840 --> 00:17:02,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Better not say it.</font>

419
00:17:07,120 --> 00:17:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Promise me:</font>

420
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Never deceive me again.</font>

421
00:17:10,360 --> 00:17:11,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

422
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomorrow, go buy some women's clothes.</font>

423
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then come with me into Nightfall Haven.</font>

424
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're not willing?</font>

425
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, I am.</font>

426
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:26,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

427
00:17:27,230 --> 00:17:28,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

428
00:17:28,900 --> 00:17:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

429
00:17:32,820 --> 00:17:37,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

430
00:17:37,500 --> 00:17:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

431
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:45,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

432
00:17:46,010 --> 00:17:50,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

433
00:17:50,340 --> 00:17:55,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

434
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:02,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

435
00:18:03,150 --> 00:18:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

436
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:11,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

437
00:18:11,740 --> 00:18:14,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

438
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:19,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

439
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
